{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>下周二攪珠的六合彩金多寶，馬會將試行「集氣加碼制」，即投注額越多，金多寶金額相應遞增，估計頭獎最高8,000萬。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.LOTTERY-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026KzZM8tu77b1795103275.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>馬會指，會根據下周一下午二時錄得的累積投注額，釐定金多寶金額及估計頭獎金額，如投注額低於6,000萬，頭獎最高6,800萬；投注額6,000萬至不足7,000萬，頭獎最高7,300萬；若投注額達7,000萬或以上，頭獎最高達8,000萬。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.LOTTERY-2300.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026CofmW63jEE1795103303.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>據了解加碼制暫時只會推出一次，馬會會視乎各界反應才決定會否恆常化。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T16:40:46.327816+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":210,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T15:19:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T15:17:21.503967+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T16:33:58.169986+00:00","content_hash":"bc187cf9d1e0984eeb612a331cbe95fd3f57b1f2a224a3a9065085feda86527c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T16:40:46.327816+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}